{"id":"087f6cd4ae08e7d5","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-shellorthogonal.md","title":"Orthogonal DNF induced by a shelling","display":"thm-shellorthogonal — Orthogonal DNF induced by a shelling","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-shellorthogonal","aliases":["27-thm-shellorthogonal"],"display":"thm-shellorthogonal — Orthogonal DNF induced by a shelling","depends_on":["[[27-df-shelling]]","[[27-df-dnf]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-shellorthogonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-shellorthogonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shellorthogonal — Orthogonal DNF induced by a shelling"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" href=\"?note=45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" title=\"27-df-shelling\">27-df-shelling</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> is injective, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j=\\mathbf T(j)\">\\(T_j=\\mathbf T(j)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)\\)</span> holds as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" href=\"?note=45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" title=\"27-df-shelling\">27-df-shelling</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathbf U:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall j\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathbf U(j)(a)=T_j(a)\\prod_{1\\le i&lt;j}(1-T_i(a))\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in[m]\\;(i\\ne j\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathbf U(i)(a)\\mathbf U(j)(a)=0)\\right)\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf U)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf T)\\land|\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf U|=m\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathbf U:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall j\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathbf U(j)(a)=T_j(a)\\prod_{1\\le i&lt;j}(1-T_i(a))\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in[m]\\;(i\\ne j\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathbf U(i)(a)\\mathbf U(j)(a)=0)\\right)\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf U)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf T)\\land|\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf U|=m\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §7.2.1, Theorem 7.3，印刷页 331，PDF 第 355 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对定义推论：shelling 给每块一个非零项，差分块两两不交且并为原真点集；非零不交项必互异，故项数恰为 m。空序列两边均零，结论仍成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-shelling","status":"resolved","id":"45a8b0be7d3a8fde","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-shelling]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-shelling","status":"resolved","id":"45a8b0be7d3a8fde","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m\\in\\mathbb N$, $\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n$ is injective, $T_j=\\mathbf T(j)$, and $\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)$ holds as in [[27-df-shelling]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf T:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_j=\\mathbf T(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathbf U:[m]\\to\\mathrm{Term}_n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall j\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathbf U(j)(a)=T_j(a)\\prod_{1\\le i<j}(1-T_i(a))\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in[m]\\;(i\\ne j\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathbf U(i)(a)\\mathbf U(j)(a)=0)\\right)\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf U)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf T)\\land|\\operatorname{ran}\\mathbf U|=m\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-559","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-shellorthogonal|thm-shellorthogonal — Orthogonal DNF induced by a shelling]]"}],"outgoing":["45a8b0be7d3a8fde","0b618255959ff4bc","5d10aed668d85817"]}